        "spec": {
          "id": 6,
          "title": "Sequencer Delay",
          "description": "The sequencer delay on the overall BFT connection, i.e., the difference between wallclock time and record time of the last received event where an event only counts as received once it has been received from a threshold of SVs.\n\nNote that this only changes when a new event is received so if no events are received it will not go up.",
